  "objective": "Continue canonical Problem prl-22e670302757c9b7663170e226ed7c26 rev1. Fix the newly observed automatic-recovery retry storm only. Root cause: RuntimeOrchestrator.supervise catches typed UPDATE_INCOMPLETE/full_clean_activation_required from soft recovery after source revision drift, logs retryAfterMs, and retries indefinitely every watchdog tick. Preserve assertActivationRevisionContinuity and all fail-closed source/epoch guards. Make deterministic source-authority/revision mismatch latch autoRecoveryBlocked with a typed lastStartFailure/recovery projection so later supervise ticks do not invoke another automatic recovery until an explicit authorized start/full-clean path clears the block. Add a focused regression proving one recovery attempt then zero repeats across later supervise ticks, while transient failures retain bounded retry behavior. Preserve unrelated dirty work. No restart, reboot, commit, push, release, install, or packaging in this wave.",
